# Build & test with project context detection
# Run this from the yaak repo root so --context picks up Cargo.toml
Output "05-context-build.gif"
Set Width 800
Set Height 400
Set FontSize 16
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 60ms

Hide
Type "clear"
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Show

Type "yaak --context build and test the project"
Enter
Sleep 2s

Enter
Sleep 3s
